en instrumental in executing strategic corporate governance and compliance operations. [...] ##### Shantee Global Realty Llp\n\nRaaz Mohammed Abdulsamad Pathan was officially appointed as a Director of Shantee Global Realty Llp on 02-05-2023.\n\n##### Saffronscape Homemakers Llp\n\nRaaz Mohammed Abdulsamad Pathan was officially appointed as a Director of Saffronscape Homemakers Llp on 02-05-2023.\n\n#### Entity Portfolio\n\n##### SHANTEE HOMES REALTY LLP\n\n##### SHANTEE GLOBAL REALTY LLP\n\n##### SAFFRONSCAPE HOMEMAKERS LLP\n\n##### Partner Responsibilities\n\nDesignated partners are responsible for the compliance of all acts required to be done by the LLP in respect of compliance with the LLP Act.\n\n###### Network Intelligence\n\nLogo\n\nIndia's premier corporate intelligence portal — accurate, real-time insights into millions of businesses, built for professionals.\n\n#### Directories [...] Currently, Raaz Mohammed Abdulsamad Pathan is actively associated as a partner or designated partner with 3 registered Limited Liability Partnerships (LLPs) in India. These entities operate across multiple key sectors of the national economy. In their capacity as a designated partner, Raaz Mohammed Abdulsamad Pathan maintains full accountability for legal compliance, regulatory reporting, and financial transparency obligations mandated under the Limited Liability Partnership Act of India.","score":0.4959723,"raw_content":null,"id":"90a2a4-03"},{"url":"https://www.zaubacorp.com/RAAZ-MOHAMMED-ABDULSAMAD-PATHAN-06382177","title":"RAAZ MOHAMMED ABDULSAMAD PATHAN | ZaubaCorp","content":"RAAZ MOHAMMED ABDULSAMAD PATHAN is a director registered with Ministry of Corporate Affairs. Their Director Identification Number (DIN) is 06382177.","score":0.43165663,"raw_content":null,"id":"a9c7a8-04"},{"url":"https://www.thecompanycheck.com/company/saffronscape-homemakers-llp/ACA-9298","title":"Saffronscape Homemakers Llp - 2026 Insights","content":"Saffronscape Homemakers Llp Company Logo\n\n# Saffronscape Homemakers Llp\n\n## About Saffronscape Homemakers Llp\n\nData last updated: 13 February 2026\n\nSaffronscape Homemakers Llp is a limited liability partnership company based in Vasai, Maharashtra, India. It specialises in construction services, a part of the broader construction sector. Incorporated on 02 May 2023.\n\nRegistered with ROC Mumbai under LLPIN ACA-9298.\n\nCapital: a total obligation of contribution of ₹1 Lakh. It is led by designated partners including Raaz Mohammed Abdulsamad Pathan and Ayazmohammad Abdulsamad Pathan.\n\nAccounts filed on 31 March 2025. Office: Ground Floor Sai Shradhha Banglow Sr.No.21/C, Sr.No.21/C/1 Revenue Village Navghar Shastri Nagar Vasai – Virar City M Corp Vasai Palghar, Maharashtra, India – 401202. [...] Saffronscape Homemakers Llp is an active limited liability partnership in the construction sector based in Vasai, Maharashtra, India. It was incorporated on 02 May 2023 (3+ years old) and is registered under LLPIN ACA-9298.\n\nThe current designated partners of Saffronscape Homemakers Llp are:\n\n Raaz Mohammed Abdulsamad Pathan - Designated Partner\n Ayazmohammad Abdulsamad Pathan - Designated Partner\n Kadar Khaja Hussain Khilledar - Designated Partner\n\nThe primary industry of Saffronscape Homemakers Llp is construction. The LLP specifically operates in construction services. The LLP is currently active in this sector. [...] | Name | Designation | Appointment Date | Tenure | Status |\n ---  --- \n| Raaz Mohammed Abdulsamad Pathan Also directs: Shantee Homes Realty Llp, Shantee Paramount Realtors Llp, Pro-Dev Kapasi Properties Llp and 5 more | Designated Partner | 02 May 2023 | 3 Years 4 Months | Current |\n| Ayazmohammad Abdulsamad Pathan Also directs: Shantee Paramount Realtors Llp, Shantee Construction & Engineering Private Limited | Designated Partner | 02 May 2023 | 3 Years 4 Months | Current |\n| Kadar Khaja Hussain Khilledar Also directs: Shantee Star Homemaker Llp, Malvani Vr Constructions Llp, Shantee Construction & Engineering Private Limited | Designated Partner | 02 May 2023 | 3 Years 4 Months | Current |\n\n## Financials of Saffronscape Homemakers Llp FY 2025 filings available","score":0.42634606,"raw_content":null,"id":"d81c33-05"},{"url":"https://mahavastu.maharashtra.gov.in/index.php?%3D%3D","title":"building plan management system - BPMS","content":"Kindly subscribe to the Official BPMS YouTube Channel. ;Raaz Mohammed AbdulSamad Pathan 18-08-2026","score":0.340398,"raw_content":null,"id":"a0a9d6-06"},{"url":"https://lei.report/LEI/984500X9D53E3B658960","title":"RAAZ MOHAMMED ABDULSAMAD PATHAN | LEI.report","content":"Legal Entity Identifier record\n\n# RAAZ MOHAMMED ABDULSAMAD PATHAN\n\nGLEIF source publication: Aug 31, 2026, 12:00 AM UTC\n\n## Legal address\n\n## Headquarters address\n\n## Entity details\n\n## Registration\n\n## Other names\n\n## Entity events\n\n### CHANGE\\_HQ\\_ADDRESS\n\nCOMPLETED · Effective Jan 31, 2026, 12:00 AM UTC\n\n### CHANGE\\_LEGAL\\_ADDRESS\n\nCOMPLETED · Effective Jan 31, 2026, 12:00 AM UTC\n\n## Ownership relationships\n\nNo active parent or child relationship is present in the current relationship release.\n\n## Identifier mappings and exceptions\n\n### BIC mappings (0)\n\nNone in the current mapping.\n\n### ISIN mappings (0)\n\nNone in the current mapping.\n\n### MIC mappings (0)\n\nNone in the current mapping.\n\n### GEM mappings (0)\n\nNone in the current mapping.\n\n### QCC mappings (0) [...] None in the current mapping.\n\n### QCC mappings (0)\n\nNone in the current mapping.\n\n### DIRECT\\_ACCOUNTING\\_CONSOLIDATION\\_PARENT\n\nNATURAL\\_PERSONS\n\n### ULTIMATE\\_ACCOUNTING\\_CONSOLIDATION\\_PARENT\n\nNATURAL\\_PERSONS\n\nOfficial publication history\n\n## Recent changes\n\nNo field change has been recovered for this LEI since archive coverage began on Feb 13, 2018, 12:00 AM UTC.\n\nView the GLEIF record\n\nIndependent access to public Legal Entity Identifier data. Not affiliated with or endorsed by GLEIF or an